{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "dist",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[抽样分布|抽样分布]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Sampling distribution*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "bias",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": -320,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[估计量偏差|偏差：中心减目标]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Bias: centre minus target*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "unbiased",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": -320,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[估计量无偏性|无偏性]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Unbiasedness*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "efficient",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[估计量有效性|有效性：限定比较类别]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Efficiency within a stated class*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "consistent",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[估计量一致性|一致性]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Consistency*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "mse",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[均方误差|均方误差]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Mean squared error*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "decomp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## [[MSE偏差方差分解|MSE = Bias² + Var]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Bias–variance decomposition*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "counter1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": -320,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## [[无偏不推出一致|只用 X₁：无偏但不一致]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*First observation: unbiased, inconsistent*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "counter2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## [[一致不推出无偏|均值 + 1/n：有偏但一致]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Mean plus 1/n: biased, consistent*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "shift",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## [[固定偏移破坏一致性|均值 + 5：集中到错误中心]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Fixed shift: the wrong limit*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "blue",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## [[经典 Gauss–Markov 定理|Gauss–Markov：BLUE]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Best linear unbiased estimator*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "cr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## [[Cramér–Rao下界|Cramér–Rao 下界]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Unbiased variance bound*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[依概率收敛|依概率收敛]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Convergence in probability*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    }
  ],
